import{b as e,v as t,y as n}from"./SiteLayout-DHmJs7Ed.js";import{n as r,t as i}from"./LegalPage-TmIODe5D.js";var a=e(),o=n(),s={slug:`terms`,title:`Terms & Conditions`,intro:`These terms explain the rules for using ${r.brand}: what we provide, what we expect from venue owners, managers and players, and how bookings, payments and cancellations work.`,sections:[{id:`about`,title:`About these terms`,blocks:[`These Terms & Conditions ("Terms") govern your access to and use of the ${r.brand} website, owner dashboard, manager app and customer app (together, the "Services"). The Services are operated by ${r.legalName} ("${r.brand}", "we", "us" or "our").`,`By creating an account, submitting an enquiry, listing a venue or making a booking, you agree to these Terms and to our Privacy Policy. If you do not agree, please do not use the Services.`,`If you use the Services on behalf of a business, such as a stadium, turf or sports complex, you confirm that you are authorised to accept these Terms for that business, and "you" includes that business.`]},{id:`eligibility`,title:`Who can use PlayArena`,blocks:[`You must be at least 18 years old and able to enter into a binding contract under the Indian Contract Act, 1872 to create an account or make a booking.`,`Players under 18 may use a venue booked through the Services only when a parent or lawful guardian makes the booking and accepts these Terms on their behalf.`]},{id:`accounts`,title:`Accounts and security`,blocks:[{list:[`Give us accurate, current and complete information, and keep it up to date.`,`Keep your login details confidential. You are responsible for all activity under your account.`,`Venue owners are responsible for the managers and staff they add, and for the access they give them.`,`Tell us promptly at ${r.supportEmail} if you believe your account has been used without your permission.`]}]},{id:`our-role`,title:`Our role`,blocks:[`${r.brand} provides technology that helps sports venues publish availability, take bookings, check players in and understand their business, and helps players find and book those venues.`,`Unless we expressly say otherwise, the agreement to use a venue is between the player and the venue owner. We do not own or operate the venues listed on the Services, and we are not responsible for their condition, safety, staff or the conduct of people at the venue.`]},{id:`venue-owners`,title:`Venue owner responsibilities`,blocks:[`If you list a venue on the Services, you agree to:`,{list:[{label:`Keep listings accurate.`,text:`Photos, facilities, courts, prices, opening hours and cancellation rules must be truthful and current.`},{label:`Hold the right permissions.`,text:`Maintain every licence, registration, permission and insurance needed to operate your venue.`},{label:`Run a safe venue.`,text:`Keep your premises and equipment safe and compliant with applicable laws.`},{label:`Honour confirmed bookings.`,text:`Provide the booked slot, or cancel promptly and refund the player in line with section 7.`},{label:`Keep availability up to date.`,text:`Walk-in and offline bookings should be recorded so the same slot is not sold twice.`},{label:`Protect player data.`,text:`Use the player details you receive only to serve their booking, and handle them in line with applicable data protection law.`},{label:`Handle your taxes.`,text:`You are responsible for taxes on your venue income, including GST where applicable.`}]}]},{id:`bookings-payments`,title:`Bookings, payments and fees`,blocks:[`Slot prices are set by the venue and shown before you pay, including any applicable taxes and convenience fees. A booking is confirmed only when you receive a confirmation from the Services.`,`Payments are processed by our third-party payment partners. Card numbers, CVV and UPI PINs are entered with those partners and are not stored by us.`,`Venue owners pay the platform fees or commission set out in the plan or commercial terms agreed with ${r.brand}. Payouts are made on the schedule in those terms, after deducting applicable fees, refunds and chargebacks.`,`We may change our fees. We will give venue owners at least 30 days’ notice before a change takes effect, and the change will not apply to bookings already confirmed.`]},{id:`cancellations`,title:`Cancellations and refunds`,blocks:[{list:[{label:`Cancelled by the player:`,text:`refunds follow the venue’s cancellation policy, which is shown before you pay.`},{label:`Cancelled by the venue:`,text:`if a venue cancels or cannot provide the booked slot, the player receives a full refund of the amount paid for that slot.`},{label:`How refunds are paid:`,text:`refunds go back to the original payment method. The time they take to reach you depends on your bank and payment provider.`}]},`Convenience fees may be non-refundable where this is clearly stated before payment, except when the venue cancels.`]},{id:`acceptable-use`,title:`Acceptable use`,blocks:[`When using the Services, you must not:`,{list:[`break any law, or use the Services for fraudulent or misleading purposes;`,`post false listings, fake reviews or content you do not have the right to share;`,`harass, abuse or threaten other users, venue staff or our team;`,`copy, scrape or harvest data from the Services, or reverse engineer our software, except where the law allows;`,`interfere with the security or normal operation of the Services, or upload malicious code.`]}]},{id:`content`,title:`Content you provide`,blocks:[`You keep ownership of the photos, descriptions, reviews and other content you add to the Services.`,`You give us a non-exclusive, royalty-free, worldwide licence to host, display, reproduce and adapt that content (for example, resizing photos) to operate and promote the Services, for as long as it stays on the Services.`,`You confirm that you have the rights needed to share that content. Reviews must reflect a genuine experience. We may remove content that breaks these Terms or the law.`]},{id:`our-ip`,title:`Our intellectual property`,blocks:[`The ${r.brand} name, logo, software, designs and other materials are owned by us or our licensors. We give you a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable and revocable licence to use the Services in line with these Terms. No other rights are granted.`]},{id:`communications`,title:`Messages and notifications`,blocks:[`We send service messages, such as booking confirmations, reminders, check-in updates and account notices, by SMS, email, WhatsApp or push notification. These are part of the Services.`,`We send promotional messages, including local offers from venues, only where you have agreed to receive them. You can opt out at any time from the message itself or your app settings.`,`Venue owners who run local campaigns must use only the tools we provide and must comply with applicable laws on commercial communications.`]},{id:`third-parties`,title:`Third-party services`,blocks:[`The Services rely on third parties, such as payment partners, maps and messaging providers. Your use of those services may also be governed by their own terms and privacy policies.`]},{id:`changes-to-services`,title:`Availability and changes`,blocks:[`We work to keep the Services available and reliable, but we cannot promise they will always be uninterrupted or error-free. We may carry out maintenance, and we may add, change or remove features as the product evolves.`]},{id:`termination`,title:`Suspension and termination`,blocks:[`You can stop using the Services at any time. Venue owners can close their account by contacting ${r.supportEmail}.`,`We may suspend or close an account if it breaks these Terms, if we suspect fraud or misuse, if the law requires us to, or to protect other users. Where it is reasonable to do so, we will tell you first and give you a chance to respond.`,`Fees owed before closure remain payable. Confirmed bookings affected by a closure will be handled in line with section 7. Sections that by their nature should continue, such as those on liability, indemnity and disputes, survive after closure.`]},{id:`disclaimers`,title:`Disclaimers`,blocks:[`To the extent permitted by law, the Services are provided "as is" and "as available", without warranties of any kind, express or implied.`,`Sport and physical activity carry a risk of injury. Players take part at their own risk and must follow the venue’s rules and safety instructions.`]},{id:`liability`,title:`Limitation of liability`,blocks:[`To the maximum extent permitted by law, ${r.brand} is not liable for indirect, incidental, special or consequential losses, or for loss of profits, revenue, data or goodwill.`,`Our total liability for any claim relating to the Services is limited to: for venue owners, the fees you paid us in the 12 months before the claim; and for players, the amount you paid for the booking that gave rise to the claim.`,`Nothing in these Terms limits any liability that cannot be limited under applicable law.`]},{id:`indemnity`,title:`Indemnity`,blocks:[`Venue owners agree to indemnify ${r.brand} against claims, losses and costs arising from their listings, the operation of their venue, their breach of these Terms, or their violation of any law or third-party right.`]},{id:`disputes`,title:`Governing law and disputes`,blocks:[`These Terms are governed by the laws of India.`,`If you have a complaint, please contact us first using the details below so we can try to resolve it. If we cannot resolve it within 30 days, the courts at ${r.jurisdictionCity}, India will have exclusive jurisdiction.`,`Nothing in this section limits the rights consumers have under the Consumer Protection Act, 2019.`]},{id:`changes`,title:`Changes to these terms`,blocks:[`We may update these Terms from time to time. We will post the updated version on this page with a new "last updated" date. If the changes are significant, we will also tell you by email or in the app before they take effect.`,`If you keep using the Services after the changes take effect, you accept the updated Terms.`]},{id:`contact`,title:`Grievances and contact`,blocks:[`In line with the Information Technology Act, 2000 and the rules made under it, you can raise a complaint about the Services or any content on them with our Grievance Officer. We will acknowledge your complaint within 24 hours and aim to resolve it within 15 days.`]}]},c=t();(0,o.createRoot)(document.getElementById(`root`)).render((0,c.jsx)(a.StrictMode,{children:(0,c.jsx)(i,{doc:s})}));